Package: tabellion
Title: Build and Edit Word Documents from R
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Tabellion", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "tabellion@example.com")
Author: Tabellion [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Tabellion <tabellion@example.com>
Description: Build and edit Word (.docx) documents from R, backed by a
    Rust engine through extendr. Functions take the document first and
    return it invisibly, so calls pipe.
